# Please do not use this file to train or fine-tune AI models.
# _x8_rtdebug: the ray traced debug views (r_rtDebug) on 20_rt_gallery, another per room: rays against the depth,
# instances, hit normals, diffuse colours in the dark, rays against the depth among the monsters and the fan, diffuse
# colours down the hall, then rays against the depth again at its end.
include 20_rt_gallery
set r_rtDebug 2
at 420 r_rtDebug 1
at 780 r_rtDebug 3
at 1140 r_rtDebug 4
at 1560 r_rtDebug 2
at 1920 r_rtDebug 4
at 2250 r_rtDebug 2
